� Let's set up your AI chat experience with multiple providers, tools, and integrations.
� Select AI providers to configure: (GPT-4 Most capable, best for complex tasks)
� Select integrations to set up (GitHub, Discord, Telegram, Notion, Spotify, Gmail, Slack, Twitter/X, Browser automation, File system access
